# Never upload these to Vercel.
#
# .env.local holds a local development API key and a 127.0.0.1 API URL. Vercel
# uploads the directory it is given and does NOT respect .gitignore, so without
# this file the key would be sent to a third party and baked into a public bundle.
# The deployed build gets its configuration from the project's environment
# variables instead.
.env*
node_modules
dist
coverage
